    "suggestions": [
      "Refactor `extract_tests_from_file` to be TDD-compliant from day one (e.g., write the test first, then implement extraction logic).",
      "Ensure the helper function is unit-tested with its own tests that cover edge cases like empty files or malformed syntax."
